    "description": "<b>Glitter Wallpaper is a free android wallpaper app, with large amount of high definition glitter wallpapers and live wallpapers, you'll love this cute wallpapers for girls! </b>\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a beautiful wallpaper to change your phone display, download Glitter Wallpaper ,you'll get a big surprise! There are 10000+ free glitter wallpapers for homescreen and lock screen to choose from, romantic, love, kawaii, various of glitter images that designed for wallpapers, all wallpapers are suitable for mobile screen size with full display, and all Images have high quality resolutions, bring you a colorful screen! Install the best free Glitter Wallpaper app, you can discover amazing wallpapers. Enjoy changing your screen daily with this Glitter Girl Wallpaper, make your android phone display more beautiful and unique!\u2765(^_-)\r\n\r\nGlitter Wallpaper is an awesome tool with best wallpapers and cool backgrounds, grab it and have a new look for your phone!\r\n\r\n<b>App Features</b>\r\n<b>-Plenty of options: </b> \r\nThere are many topics in our app,you can easily find your exclusive wallpapers! \r\n<b>-More styles: </b> \r\nSupports Ultra HD wallpapers,4K wallpapers,Live video wallapers, Parallax 4D wallpapers to use as backgrounds!\r\n<b>-Easy to use: </b> \r\nOption to apply lock screen wallpapers, home screen wallpapers, or both at the same time,compatibility with 99% of any device, and don\u2019t worry about drain your battery.\r\n<b>-High Quality image: </b> \r\nEvery wallpaper is checked carefully and make sure a perfect display.\r\n<b>-Daily updates: </b> \r\nHuge collection of popular and breathtaking best wallpapers & backgrounds , lots of Glitter Wallpaper are added everyday, pick your favorite and get a good mood!\r\n\r\n<b>How to use Glitter Wallpaper</b>\r\nStep1\ufe0f\uff1aDownload and install Glitter Wallpaper\r\nStep2\ufe0f\uff1aPick a wallpaper you like\r\nStep3\ufe0f\uff1aApply background on home screen, lock screen, or both\r\nStep4\ufe0f\uff1aShow off your personality and stand out!\r\n\r\nGet the wallpaper to save your day! Install Glitter Wallpaper now, stand out from the crowd!\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t forget to rate and review Glitter Wallpaper, your encouragement is our greatest motivation\uff01",
